<!--
  ABYSS_DONOR_BEASTS_FREED_1. The quill predator (cast bible 2026-10-01 §4C; owner named it "Drokattak").
  Replaces the donor-bodied zhurrakor (GR_Nighthrumbo): own race and art, no donor dependency. Free RM_ tier,
  ONE HOME: the Abyss. An ambusher: before a hunt or attack it raises its quills in a clattering hackle
  (RM_CompQuillHackle.cs, setting drokattakHackleEnabled). It never throws them (the vrakk's lane).
-->
<Defs>

  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>RM_Drokattak</defName>
    <label>drokattak</label>
    <description>A heavy, low-slung night hunter with powerful forequarters, a short broad muzzle and dark ochre hide. Its back is a crown of long sensory quills, banded bone and rust, that fan from neck to haunch. In the Dark it hunts by feel, its quills picking up the tremor of anything moving; before it lunges and pins, it raises them in a clattering hackle. It does not throw them, and it does not chase far.</description>
